 /api/requests with a JSON body; the httpOnly session cookie travels automatically.&lt;br&gt;3.  Auth guard loads the session, confirms role = student, and hands the call to the Requests module.&lt;br&gt;4.  Requests module validates the chosen pickup slot (capacity, not in the past) and calls the data layer.&lt;br&gt;5.  One PostgreSQL transaction inserts the request + an audit_log row: both commit, or neither does.&lt;br&gt;6.  API returns 201 Created to the browser; only then is the email task started (asynchronous).&lt;br&gt;7.  Email API sends the confirmation. If it fails, the error is logged; the request itself still exists." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#C9B458;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="680" width="1000" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#C9B458;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="680" width="500" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="Legend" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1072" y="688" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1F2933;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1076" y="724" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1146" y="724" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="Synchronous 